meta {
  name: saveProductAttachment
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveProductAttachment",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "_attachments": [
        {
          "product_attachment_id": 1,
          "order": 1,
          "_delete": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Link or reorder document attachments on a product

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `product_id` | integer | yes | Internal ID of the product to update attachments for |
  | `_attachments` | object[] | yes | List of attachments to link, reorder, or unlink |

  **Example: Link attachment to product**. Set _delete=true on an attachment entry to unlink it from the product.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveProductAttachment",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "_attachments": [
        {
          "product_attachment_id": 1,
          "order": 1,
          "_delete": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_id": 123
  }
  ```
}
